    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** Eligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant **\r\n\r\nSherry Property are delighted to present this excellent renovation opportunity to the market. Situated on approximately 0.5 acres, this two-storey detached property is located in Collon, Co. Louth, close to the Louth/Meath border.\r\n\r\nThe property requires renovation and currently comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen, living room, four bedrooms and family bathroom. Offering generous accommodation and a substantial site, the property presents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to renovate and create a spacious family home.\r\n\r\nIdeally located approximately 12km from Drogheda, 6km from Tullyallen and 9km from Slane, the property enjoys a convenient rural setting while remaining within easy reach of a wide range of amenities and transport links. The M1 motorway is readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and Belfast, with Dublin Airport also easily accessible via the motorway.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 0.5-acre site, the property offers considerable potential for those seeking a detached home with ample outdoor space. Its location, site size and eligibility for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant make this an appealing proposition for both homeowners and those seeking a worthwhile renovation project.\r\n\r\nContact Sherry Propery to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
